          "settings": {
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/5016ad755272cc43c5edb578256251df_2c0c9949-e858-4228-a51b-5e91ffde46ab.png",
            "title": "Cleaned and serviced",
            "text": "<p>Equipment is polished, inspected, lubricated, and adjusted for proper function. No major rebuilding or component replacement. Sold closer to as-is condition. Best for: Casual or low-traffic use where upfront cost matters more than long-term reliability.</p><p><strong>We do not sell equipment in this condition.</strong></p>",
